/target
# Anything that could hold a key, a recording, or a transcript. Broad on
# purpose: the cost of an ignored file is that it needs `git add -f`, and the
# cost of a missed one is a rotated credential.
*.env
nebula.env
config.toml
*.pem
*.key
credentials*
/secrets*
*.log
*.wav
*.flac
*.opus
recordings/
transcripts/
# Trained or downloaded wake-word models.
*.ppn
*.onnx
*.tflite
models/

.work/
*.bin

# Local agent tooling cache.
.atl/
